note contract 5 fresh, line 127: passing the fresh array to write is error 27, even after every
note element is written.
om2
fn f s edit uchar 8 fresh to ulong
for i ulong 8 unroll
put s i 65
end
w = write 1 s 0 8
ret 0
end
fn main to int
a = new uchar 8 0
putd f a
ret 0
end
